      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REMISSION RUN (1) hit the ground running off the inside draw with a fast early sectional but run over late and missed the frame when a 4 length fourth (17.44) over 300m at this track. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Better than last start and worth following up. MAJESTIC EMMY (5) hit the ground running from an outside draw with a fast early split, holding on for a minor placing when third and beaten 6 lengths at this track over 300m in 17.66. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Expected to feature again. SHE'S SILKY (2) comes off an average run last start when fifth at this track over 300m behind Redeem A Arcadia (17.87) in a Grade 3/4. Was in the money the start prior. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Shapes as one to consider. FASCINATE MARK (8) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
